		(property "Description" "Sensirion SPS30 particulate matter (PM1.0/2.5/4.0/10) sensor, 5-pin JST ZHR-5 connector per Sensirion's own pinout: 1 VDD(5V,red) 2 SDA(green) 3 SCL(yellow) 4 SEL(blue, pull to GND before/at power-up to select I2C) 5 GND(black). I2C address 0x69." (at 66.04 55.88 90) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
